        {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "text",
                    "content": "Based on your preferences and budget, I have some excellent recommendations for your trip to Paris!\n\n**Restaurant Recommendation: Le Baratin**\n- **Rating:** 4.8/5\n- **Cuisine:** Authentic French\n- **Address:** 3 Rue Jouye-Rouve, 75020 Paris, France\n- **Reviews:** This small, cozy bistro offers delicious homestyle cooking with a daily changing menu based on fresh market ingredients. It features an excellent natural wine selection and has a great view of the city. Note that it's cash only, so be sure to bring cash!\n\n**Hotel Recommendation: Montmartre Suites**\n- **Rating:** 4.7/5\n- **Price Range:** 110-200 euros per night (well within your 500 euro budget!)\n- **Address:** 23 Rue Lepic, 75018 Paris, France\n- **Reviews:** Guests praise the luxurious suites with stunning views of Montmartre, impeccable cleanliness, and staff that goes above and beyond. It's perfectly located for exploring the charming Montmartre neighborhood, and the in-room breakfast service is a delightful touch.\n\nBoth Le Baratin and Montmartre Suites offer exceptional quality at reasonable prices, making them perfect choices for your Parisian adventure. The restaurant is ideal for both lunch and dinner with its authentic French cuisine, and the hotel provides comfort and value within your budget.\n\nEnjoy your trip to Paris! \ud83c\uddeb\ud83c\uddf7"
                }
            ],
